gsplus (Apple IIgs emulator)

Modern cross-platform Apple IIgs emulator and tools based on KEGS.
gsplus uses SDL3 for graphics and audio, and is still in a somewhat
experimental stage, though most things seem to work well already.

Note: the PDF manual in /usr/doc/gsplus-$VERSION is for an older
version of gsplus; it's included in hopes that it will be useful, but
it may be outdated.
